---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Scripture from '../components/Scripture.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="A Note from the Pastor"
  description="A personal welcome from Pastor Daniel, Founder and Senior Pastor of El Shaddai Living Waters Church Sydney."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="A Note from the Pastor"
    title="Thank you for taking the time to learn about our church"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <div class="prose-measure text-[1.09rem] leading-[1.75] text-ink">
      <p>
        Thank you for taking the time to learn more about El Shaddai Living
        Waters Church, Sydney, Australia.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        It is our prayer that this will be a place where you can know Jesus, grow
        in His Word, experience the presence of the Holy Spirit, and find a
        church family where you can serve and grow.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        If you are not currently attending a church, or if you are prayerfully
        looking for a church family where you can be part of a Christ-centred and
        Spirit-filled vision, we warmly invite you to come and worship with us.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        If our vision and mission speak to your heart, we would be blessed to
        have you become part of what God is doing through El Shaddai Living
        Waters Church Sydney.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        We are not looking to simply fill a church building. We want to build
        people for Christ, reach souls, make disciples, serve our community and
        prepare one another for the coming of Jesus.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        Thank you for visiting us and for taking the time to read about our
        church. May the Lord guide you, bless you and your family, and lead you
        into all that He has prepared for you.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-9 text-ink-muted">With prayers and every blessing,</p>

      <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-4">
        {site.pastor.photo ? (
          <img
            src={site.pastor.photo}
            alt={site.pastor.name}
            width="72"
            height="72"
            class="h-18 w-18 rounded-full object-cover"
          />
        ) : null}
        <div>
          <p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-xl font-semibold text-blue-900">
            {site.pastor.name}
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">{site.pastor.role}</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">{site.name} Sydney</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 border-t border-gold-500/30 pt-8">
        <Scripture reference="Numbers 6:24 (KJV)">
          The Lord bless thee, and keep thee.
        </Scripture>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a
        href="/visit"
        class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-gold-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-900 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-gold-300"
      >
        Plan your visit
      </a>
      <a
        href="/mission-vision"
        class="inline-flex rounded-lg border border-blue-900/25 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-900 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-blue-900/5"
      >
        Our mission &amp; vision
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
